## 10. Non-Functional Requirements

| Category | Requirements |
|---|---|
| **Performance** | Reasonable loading time; smooth interaction where hardware permits; optimized 3D assets; efficient memory usage. |
| **Usability** | Simple controls; clear interface; minimal unnecessary UI; easy-to-understand interaction. |
| **Compatibility** | Modern desktop browsers; responsive layout where practical. |
| **Reliability** | Graceful loading failures; no broken viewer when assets fail to load; clear error messages. |
| **Maintainability** | Modular frontend structure; reconstruction pipeline separated from the web viewer; clear documentation. |

